.TH "AG\-CLI\-RUNNER\-LIST" "1" "2026\-10\-09" "AtomGit CLI 0.7.4" "AtomGit CLI Manual"
.SH NAME
\&ag\-cli\-runner\-list \- List host runners configured for a repository
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
\&ag\-cli runner list [<owner>/<repo>] [flags]
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
\&List host runners configured for a repository. This command is read\-only and does not change runner configuration.
.PP
\&When OWNER/REPO is omitted, the repository is inferred from the current Git repository. An explicit OWNER/REPO argument always takes precedence. Remote selection prefers remote.pushDefault, the current branch upstream, origin, then a unique AtomGit/GitCode remote.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
\&Output runners as JSON
\&Default: \(dqfalse\(dq.
.TP
\fB\-L, \-\-limit <int>\fR
\&Maximum number of runners to list (0 means all)
\&Default: \(dq0\(dq.
.SH INHERITED OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h, \-\-help\fR
\&Show help for command
\&Default: \(dqfalse\(dq.
.TP
\fB\-\-raw\-output\fR
\&Disable terminal output sanitization for machine processing
\&Default: \(dqfalse\(dq.
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
\&ag\-cli runner list owner/repo
\&  ag\-cli runner list owner/repo \-\-limit 25 \-\-json
.fi
